"攻击时就会失败。"

#: src/data/items.h:12344
msgid ""
"Hooks and slashes\n"
"the foe with long,\n"
"sharp claws."
msgstr ""
"用尖锐的巨爪劈开\n"
"对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/items.h:12358
msgid ""
"Generates an\n"
"ultrasonic wave\n"
"that may confuse."
msgstr ""
"用水的振动\n"
"攻击。有时会使\n"
"对手混乱。"

#: src/data/items.h:12372
msgid ""
"Raises Sp. Atk and\n"
"Sp. Def by focusing\n"
"the mind."
msgstr ""
"静心凝神，\n"
"提高自己的特攻\n"
"和特防。"

#: src/data/items.h:12386
msgid ""
"A roar that makes\n"
"the foe switch or\n"
"ends the battle."
msgstr ""
"放走对手，\n"
"强制换人或结束\n"
"野生宝可梦战斗。"

#: src/data/items.h:12400
msgid ""
"Poisons the foe\n"
"with a toxin that\n"
"gradually worsens."
msgstr ""
"让对手陷入剧毒\n"
"状态。伤害会逐\n"
"渐增加。"

#: src/data/items.h:12434
msgid ""
"Bulks up the body\n"
"to raise both\n"
"Attack & Defense."
msgstr ""
"强健肌肉，\n"
"提高自己的攻击\n"
"和防御。"

#: src/data/items.h:12448
msgid ""
"Shoots 2 to 5 seeds\n"
"in a row to strike\n"
"the foe."
msgstr ""
"向对手猛烈地发射\n"
"种子，连续攻击2\n"
"～5次。"

#: src/data/items.h:12462
msgid ""
"The type\n"
"varies among\n"
"different Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"招式的属性会随着\n"
"使用者的不同\n"
"而改变。"

#: src/data/items.h:12476
msgid ""
"Boosts the power\n"
"of Fire-type moves\n"
"for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"5回合内阳光强烈，\n"
"提高火属性招式\n"
"的威力。"

#: src/data/items.h:12568
msgid ""
"Creates a wall of\n"
"light that reduces\n"
"special damage."
msgstr ""
"制造神奇的壁障，\n"
"减弱受到的\n"
"特殊攻击。"

#: src/data/items.h:12582
msgid ""
"Negates all damage,\n"
"but may fail if used\n"
"in succession."
msgstr ""
"完全抵挡对手的\n"
"攻击。连续使用\n"
"容易失败。"

#: src/data/items.h:12596
msgid ""
"Boosts the power\n"
"of Water-type\n"
"moves for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"5回合内降大雨，\n"
"提高水属性招式\n"
"的威力。"

#: src/data/items.h:12610
msgid ""
"Recovers half the\n"
"HP of the damage \n"
"this move inflicts."
msgstr ""
"吸取对手的养分\n"
"攻击。回复伤害\n"
"一半的HP。"

#: src/data/items.h:12624
msgid ""
"Guards allies from\n"
"status problems\n"
"for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"5回合内保护我方不\n"
"会陷入异常状态。"

#: src/data/items.h:12638
msgid ""
"The less the user\n"
"likes you, the more\n"
"powerful this move."
msgstr ""
"宝可梦越不亲\n"
"近训练家，\n"
"威力越大。"

#: src/data/items.h:12652
msgid ""
"Absorbs sunlight in\n"
"the 1st turn, then\n"
"attacks next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合收集日光，\n"
"第2回合发射光\n"
"束攻击。"

#: src/data/items.h:12666
msgid ""
"Slams the foe with\n"
"a hard tail. It may\n"
"lower Defense."
msgstr ""
"用坚硬的尾巴\n"
"摔打对手。\n"
"有时会降低防御。"

#: src/data/items.h:12680
msgid ""
"A powerful electric\n"
"attack that may\n"
"cause paralysis."
msgstr ""
"向对手发出强力\n"
"电击。有时会让\n"
"对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/items.h:12694
msgid ""
"Strikes the foe\n"
"with a thunderbolt.\n"
"It may paralyze."
msgstr ""
"向对手劈下暴\n"
"雷。有时会让\n"
"对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/items.h:12708
msgid ""
"Causes a quake\n"
"that hits all\n"
"other Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"利用地震的冲击，\n"
"攻击周围所有\n"
"宝可梦。"

#: src/data/items.h:12722
msgid ""
"The more the user\n"
"likes you, the more\n"
"powerful this move."
msgstr ""
"宝可梦越亲\n"
"近训练家，\n"
"威力越大。"

#: src/data/items.h:12736
msgid ""
"Digs underground\n"
"the 1st turn, then\n"
"strikes next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合钻入地下，\n"
"第2回合攻击对手。"

#: src/data/items.h:12750
msgid ""
"A powerful psychic\n"
"attack that may\n"
"lower Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"向对手发送强\n"
"大的念力。\n"
"有时会降低特防。"

#: src/data/items.h:12764
msgid ""
"Hurls a dark lump\n"
"at the foe. It may\n"
"lower Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"投掷黑影之团\n"
"攻击。有时会降低\n"
"对手特防。"

#: src/data/items.h:12778
msgid ""
"Destroys barriers\n"
"like Light Screen\n"
"and causes damage."
msgstr ""
"破坏光墙和\n"
"反射壁等，\n"
"同时给予伤害。"

#: src/data/items.h:12792
msgid ""
"Creates illusory\n"
"copies to raise\n"
"evasiveness."
msgstr ""
"快速移动制造分\n"
"身，提高自己的\n"
"闪避率。"

#: src/data/items.h:12806
msgid ""
"Creates a wall of\n"
"light that weakens\n"
"physical attacks."
msgstr ""
"制造神奇的壁障，\n"
"减弱受到的\n"
"物理攻击。"

#: src/data/items.h:12820
msgid ""
"Zaps the foe with a\n"
"jolt of electricity\n"
"that never misses."
msgstr ""
"向对手发出电击\n"
"攻击。攻击必定\n"
"会命中。"

#: src/data/items.h:12834
msgid ""
"Looses a stream of\n"
"fire that may burn\n"
"the foe."
msgstr ""
"向对手发射烈\n"
"焰。有时会让\n"
"对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/items.h:12848
msgid ""
"Hurls sludge at the\n"
"foe. It may poison\n"
"the foe."
msgstr ""
"将污泥投掷向\n"
"对手。有时会让\n"
"对手中毒。"

#: src/data/items.h:12862
msgid ""
"Causes a sandstorm\n"
"that hits\n"
"over 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"扬起持续5回合的\n"
"沙暴，给予伤害。"

#: src/data/items.h:12876
msgid ""
"A powerful fire\n"
"attack that may\n"
"burn the foe."
msgstr ""
"用大字形的火焰\n"
"攻击。有时会让\n"
"对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/items.h:12890
msgid ""
"Stops the foe from\n"
"moving with rocks.\n"
"May lower Speed."
msgstr ""
"投掷岩石阻挡\n"
"对手。有时会降低\n"
"其速度。"

#: src/data/items.h:12904
msgid ""
"An extremely fast\n"
"attack that can't\n"
"be avoided."
msgstr ""
"以惊人的速度攻击\n"
"对手。攻击必定\n"
"会命中。"

#: src/data/items.h:12918
msgid ""
"Prevents the foe\n"
"from using the same\n"
"move in a row."
msgstr ""
"让对手不能连续\n"
"使用相同的招式。"

#: src/data/items.h:12932
msgid ""
"Boosts power when\n"
"poisoned, burned,\n"
"or paralyzed."
msgstr ""
"中毒、灼伤或麻痹\n"
"时，威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/items.h:12946
msgid ""
"Adds an effect to\n"
"attack depending\n"
"on the location."
msgstr ""
"根据使用场所不\n"
"同，追加效果也\n"
"会改变。"

#: src/data/items.h:12960
msgid ""
"The user sleeps for\n"
"2 turns to restore\n"
"health and status."
msgstr ""
"连续睡2回合，\n"
"回复HP和所有\n"
"异常状态。"

#: src/data/items.h:12974
msgid ""
"Makes it tough for\n"
"the opposite\n"
"gender to attack."
msgstr ""
"魅惑异性，\n"
"使对手变得难以使\n"
"出招式。"

#: src/data/items.h:12988
msgid ""
"While attacking,\n"
"it steals the\n"
"foe's held item."
msgstr ""
"攻击的同时盗取\n"
"对手携带的道具。"

#: src/data/items.h:13002
msgid ""
"Slams into the\n"
"foe. This may\n"
"raise Defense."
msgstr ""
"用坚硬的\n"
"翅膀攻击。\n"
"有时会提高防御。"

#: src/data/items.h:13016
msgid ""
"Switches Abilities\n"
"with the foe on the\n"
"turn this is used."
msgstr ""
"利用超能力，\n"
"互换自己和对手\n"
"的特性。"

#: src/data/items.h:13030
msgid ""
"Steals the next\n"
"healing or stat-\n"
"changing move."
msgstr ""
"抢夺对手打算使用\n"
"的回复或能力\n"
"变化招式。"

#: src/data/items.h:13044
msgid ""
"Enables full-power\n"
"attack, but harshly\n"
"lowers Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"全力攻击对手。\n"
"自己的特攻会大\n"
"幅降低。"

#: src/data/items.h:13608
msgid ""
"Attacks the foe\n"
"with sharp blades\n"
"or claws."
msgstr ""
"用镰刀或爪子等切\n"
"斩对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/items.h:13622
msgid ""
"Flies up on the\n"
"first turn, then\n"
"attacks next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合飞上天空，\n"
"第2回合攻击对手。"

#: src/data/items.h:13654
msgid ""
"Builds enormous\n"
"power, then slams\n"
"the foe."
msgstr ""
"使出浑身力气殴打\n"
"对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/items.h:13668
msgid ""
"Looses a powerful\n"
"blast of light that\n"
"lowers accuracy."
msgstr ""
"使出耀眼的强光，\n"
"降低对手的\n"
"命中率。"

#: src/data/items.h:13682
msgid ""
"A rock-crushingly\n"
"tough attack that\n"
"may lower Defense."
msgstr ""
"用拳头击碎对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手\n"
"的防御。"

#: src/data/items.h:13716
msgid ""
"Dives underwater\n"
"the 1st turn, then\n"
"attacks next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合潜入水中，\n"
"第2回合浮上\n"
"来攻击。"

#: src/data/items.h:13733
msgid ""
"Increases the\n"
"chance of finding\n"
"Pokémon Eggs."
msgstr ""
"携带后，更容易在\n"
"培育屋发现\n"
"宝可梦蛋。"

#: src/data/items.h:13749
msgid ""
"Increases the\n"
"chance of finding\n"
"Shiny Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"携带后，更容易遇\n"
"到异色宝可梦。"

#: src/data/items.h:13765
msgid ""
"Increases the\n"
"chance of getting\n"
"a critical catch."
msgstr ""
"携带后，更容易发\n"
"生会心捕获。"

#: src/data/items.h:13781
msgid ""
"Increases the\n"
"Exp. Points that\n"
"Pokémon can get."
msgstr ""
"宝可梦获得的\n"
"经验值会增加。"

#: src/data/items.h:13799
msgid ""
"Use to have Rotom\n"
"hop in and out of\n"
"the devices listed."
msgstr ""
"能让洛托姆进入\n"
"目录中的电器，\n"
"或从中出来。"

#: src/data/items.h:13815
msgid ""
"A flower given as\n"
"an expression of\n"
"gratitude."
msgstr ""
"用来表达感谢之\n"
"情的花。"

#: src/data/items.h:13832
msgid ""
"Returns a\n"
"Pokémon back to\n"
"its original shape."
msgstr ""
"能让宝可梦恢复原\n"
"来样子的镜子。"

#: src/data/items.h:13849
msgid ""
"A splicer that\n"
"fuses Kyurem and\n"
"a certain Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"能将酋雷姆和某种\n"
"宝可梦合体的\n"
"基因楔。"

#: src/data/items.h:13865
msgid ""
"An item to change\n"
"Zygarde's forms."
msgstr ""
"能改变基格尔德\n"
"形态的道具。"

#: src/data/items.h:13880
msgid ""
"A bottle used to\n"
"seal a certain\n"
"Pokémon long ago."
msgstr ""
"很久以前用来封印\n"
"某种宝可梦\n"
"的瓶子。"

#: src/data/items.h:13896
msgid ""
"Fuses or separates\n"
"Necrozma and\n"
"Solgaleo."
msgstr ""
"能让奈克洛兹玛和\n"
"索尔迦雷欧合体\n"
"或分离。"

#: src/data/items.h:13912
msgid ""
"Fuses or separates\n"
"Necrozma and\n"
"Lunala."
msgstr ""
"能让奈克洛兹玛和\n"
"露奈雅拉合体\n"
"或分离。"

#: src/data/items.h:13929
msgid ""
"Unites or\n"
"separates Calyrex\n"
"and its steed."
msgstr ""
"能让蕾冠王和它的\n"
"爱马合体或分离。"

#: src/data/items.h:13947
msgid ""
"Enables Pokémon\n"
"with Mega Stones\n"
"to Mega Evolve."
msgstr ""
"能让携带超级石的\n"
"宝可梦超级进化。"

#: src/data/items.h:13963
msgid ""
"A ring that\n"
"enables Pokémon\n"
"to use Z-Power."
msgstr ""
"能让宝可梦使用Z力\n"
"量的手环。"

#: src/data/items.h:13979
msgid ""
"Allows Pokémon to\n"
"Dynamax when at\n"
"a Power Spot."
msgstr ""
"在能量点能让\n"
"宝可梦极巨化。"

#: src/data/items.h:13996
msgid ""
"A folding bicycle\n"
"that is faster than\n"
"the Running Shoes."
msgstr ""
"比跑步鞋还要快的\n"
"折叠式自行车。"

#: src/data/items.h:14013
msgid ""
"A folding bicycle\n"
"that doubles your\n"
"speed or better."
msgstr ""
"能让移动速度提高\n"
"到2倍以上的折叠式\n"
"自行车。"

#: src/data/items.h:14030
msgid ""
"A folding bicycle\n"
"capable of jumps\n"
"and wheelies."
msgstr ""
"能跳跃和翘前轮的\n"
"折叠式自行车。"

#: src/data/items.h:14047
msgid ""
"Use by any body of\n"
"water to fish for\n"
"wild Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"在有水的地方\n"
"使用，就能钓到\n"
"野生宝可梦。"

#: src/data/items.h:14064
msgid ""
"A decent fishing\n"
"rod for catching\n"
"wild Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"性能不错的钓竿。\n"
"能钓到野生\n"
"宝可梦。"

#: src/data/items.h:14081
msgid ""
"The best fishing\n"
"rod for catching\n"
"wild Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"最好的钓竿。能钓\n"
"到野生宝可梦。"

#: src/data/items.h:14098
msgid ""
"A device that\n"
"signals an invisible\n"
"item by sound."
msgstr ""
"能用声音告诉你\n"
"看不见的道具位置\n"
"的装置。"

#: src/data/items.h:14114
msgid ""
"Can be viewed\n"
"anytime. Shows your\n"
"present location."
msgstr ""
"随时都可以查看。\n"
"能显示现在所在\n"
"的位置。"

#: src/data/items.h:14130
msgid ""
"A rechargeable unit\n"
"that flags battle-\n"
"ready Trainers."
msgstr ""
"可充电的装置。\n"
"能找出想要再战的\n"
"训练家。"

#: src/data/items.h:14150
msgid ""
"A convenient case\n"
"that holds TMs and\n"
"HMs."
msgstr ""
"能收纳招式学习器\n"
"和秘传学习器\n"
"的盒子。"

#: src/data/items.h:14167
msgid ""
"A convenient\n"
"container that\n"
"holds Berries."
msgstr ""
"能收纳树果的方便\n"
"的袋子。"

#: src/data/items.h:14183
msgid ""
"Allows access to\n"
"the Pokémon\n"
"Storage System."
msgstr ""
"能随时使用宝可梦\n"
"寄放系统。"

#: src/data/items.h:14199
msgid ""
"Appraise and fuse\n"
"Pokémon from the\n"
"party or any Box."
msgstr ""
"能对队伍或盒子里\n"
"的宝可梦进行鉴定\n"
"和炼妖。"

#: src/data/items.h:14215
msgid ""
"Grants a random\n"
"passive. If full,\n"
"rerolls the last."
msgstr ""
"随机获得1个被动\n"
"特性。已满时重新\n"
"随机最后1个。"

#: src/data/items.h:14230
msgid ""
"Gives a Pokémon a\n"
"new random third\n"
"type."
msgstr ""
"让1只宝可梦\n"
"随机获得新的\n"
"第三属性。"

#: src/data/items.h:14245
msgid ""
"A case that holds\n"
"up to 9,999 Coins."
msgstr ""
"最多能装9999枚代\n"
"币的盒子。"

#: src/data/items.h:14260
msgid ""
"Stores Berry\n"
"Powder made using\n"
"a Berry Crusher."
msgstr ""
"收纳用树果粉碎器\n"
"制作的树果粉末\n"
"的罐子。"

#: src/data/items.h:14276
msgid ""
"A tool used for\n"
"watering Berries\n"
"and plants."
msgstr ""
"用来给树果和植物\n"
"浇水的工具。"

#: src/data/items.h:14292
msgid ""
"A tool that can\n"
"search out Pokémon\n"
"hiding in grass."
msgstr ""
"能找出藏在草丛中\n"
"的宝可梦的工具。"

#: src/data/items.h:14308
msgid ""
"A case for holding\n"
"{POKEBLOCK}s made with\n"
"a Berry Blender."
msgstr ""
"收纳用树果混合器\n"
"制作的宝可方块\n"
"的盒子。"

#: src/data/items.h:14324
msgid ""
"A sack used to\n"
"gather and hold\n"
"volcanic ash."
msgstr ""
"用来收集火山灰\n"
"的袋子。"

#: src/data/items.h:14340
msgid ""
"A sweet-sounding\n"
"flute that awakens\n"
"Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"能让宝可梦醒过来\n"
"的音色悦耳\n"
"的笛子。"

#: src/data/items.h:14357
msgid ""
"Stores information\n"
"on famous people\n"
"for instant recall."
msgstr ""
"记录着名人的信\n"
"息，能随时查看。"

#: src/data/items.h:14373
msgid ""
"A TV set tuned to\n"
"an advice program\n"
"for Trainers."
msgstr ""
"正在播放训练家\n"
"指导节目的电视。"

#: src/data/items.h:14391
msgid ""
"The ticket required\n"
"for sailing on a\n"
"ferry."
msgstr ""
"乘坐渡轮时必需\n"
"的船票。"

#: src/data/items.h:14407
msgid ""
"The ticket for a\n"
"ferry to a distant\n"
"southern island."
msgstr ""
"乘坐渡轮前往遥远\n"
"南方小岛的船票。"

#: src/data/items.h:14424
msgid ""
"A ticket required\n"
"to board the ship\n"
"to Navel Rock."
msgstr ""
"乘船前往肚脐岩所\n"
"必需的船票。"

#: src/data/items.h:14440
msgid ""
"A ticket required\n"
"to board the ship\n"
"to Birth Island."
msgstr ""
"乘船前往诞生之岛\n"
"所必需的船票。"

#: src/data/items.h:14456
msgid ""
"A faded sea chart\n"
"that shows the way\n"
"to a certain island."
